FastRustDesk
============

This is an UNOFFICIAL fork of RustDesk.
It is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by RustDesk or Purslane Ltd.
"RustDesk" is a trademark of Purslane Ltd; it appears in this project's name
only to describe the software this work derives from.

Upstream:  https://github.com/rustdesk/rustdesk
Baseline:  v1.4.9 (commit 11190fa); this fork's own version: 1.5.0
License:   GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (unchanged from upstream)

Modifications made in this fork (summary; see README.md for detail):

  * macOS screen capture moved from CGDisplayStream to ScreenCaptureKit;
    minimum supported macOS raised from 10.14 to 12.3.
  * macOS capture/encode path reworked: NV12 capture, zero-copy VideoToolbox
    encoding, redundant frame comparison removed.
  * "Accessible devices" reimplemented against the open-source ID server
    instead of the commercial API.
  * Account, device grouping and same-account passwordless access added,
    requiring the companion FastRDServer.
  * Quality monitor shows whether the session is direct or relayed.
  * Windows installer file name can carry a port.
  * Product renamed to FastRustDesk.

Per AGPL-3.0 section 5, this file and README.md carry prominent notice that the
work is modified and what was changed. Modified source files additionally carry
`LOCAL FORK:` comments at each changed site explaining what differs from
upstream and why.

